    "pathway_role_summary": "CSNK1A1 is a critical negative regulator of Wnt/beta-catenin signaling through its role in the beta-catenin destruction complex, where it initiates the phosphorylation cascade leading to beta-catenin degradation. It also regulates circadian rhythm by phosphorylating PER proteins to control their degradation and modulate circadian period length. Additionally involved in p53 regulation, cell cycle control, and mTOR signaling."
